# Telling a story in Russian: was cooking, cooked, suddenly
subtitle: "Was cooking, cooked, suddenly: which Russian aspect paints the scene and which moves the story on, as Tom tells how he won."
tags: ["russian","russian aspect","telling a story","russian past tense","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/aspect","vocabulary/competitions"]
